#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:5
msgid "Polygon"
msgstr "多边形"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:8
msgid "Create polygon"
msgstr "创建多边形"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:10
msgid "The polygon can only be added to `workspace`_ from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "多边形只能从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 添加到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:12
msgid "Select the icon |icon_polygon| from `toolbar`_ to add a polygon."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_polygon| 以添加多边形。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:17
msgid "icon_polygon"
msgstr "多边形图标"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:13
msgid "Click on the initial point from the polygon in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中单击多边形的起点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:14
msgid "Click on the rest of point from the polygon in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中依次单击多边形的其余各点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:15
msgid ""
"Double click on the end position of the polygon to finish the polygon "
"edition."
msgstr "双击多边形的终点位置以完成多边形绘制。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:21
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **Settings > Display > Parts** 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:24
msgid "Polygon properties"
msgstr "多边形属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:26
msgid ""
"Element part properties can be displayed from `information panel`_ when the "
"part is selected."
msgstr "选中部件后，可以从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示元件部件属性。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:31
msgid ""
"If the `information panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Information**."
msgstr ""
"如果 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **Settings > Display > Information**"
" 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:36
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech polygon part from element"
msgstr "图：元件中的 QElectroTech 多边形部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:38
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing different polygon properties:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义不同的多边形属性："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst
msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:44
msgid ""
"The outline and filling color of the part can be defined from a list of pre-"
"defined colors. At the case of an open polygon part the filling color is "
"**None**."
msgstr "对于开放的多边形部件，填充颜色为 **None** 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:49
msgid ""
"The outline representation type can be chosen between: Normal (Continuous), "
"Dashed, Dotted or, Dots and dashes."
msgstr "轮廓表示类型可在以下选项中选择：正常（连续）、虚线、点线或点划线。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "粗细"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:54
msgid ""
"The outline thickness (Weight) can be chosen between: None, Thin, Normal, "
"Strong or High."
msgstr "轮廓粗细（线宽）可在以下选项中选择：无、细、正常、粗或高。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "几何形状"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst
msgid "Type of polygon"
msgstr "多边形类型"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:61
msgid ""
"QElectroTech has two different types of polygons, open polygon which is "
"assimilated to a group of connected lines and close polygon which is "
"assimilated to closed geometry as the rectangle."
msgstr "QElectroTech 有两种不同类型的多边形：开放多边形类似于一组相连的线条，闭合多边形类似于矩形等封闭几何图形。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "坐标"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/polygon.rst:67
msgid ""
"The polygon points coordinates (x, y) can be defined and stored in a list."
msgstr "可以定义多边形各点的坐标 (x, y)，并将其存储在列表中。"
